        <activityName xml:lang="en">Slurry solids and bark chips, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Slurry solids and bark chips, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 1000kW;
UUID: b2572f43-fa30-33c8-959d-a6d742b7bd9a
This data set includes emissions to agricultural soil due to the land farming of ash
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: bark furnace 1MW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b2572f43-fa30-33c8-959d-a6d742b7bd9a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
